### 1. Lister toutes les organisations (superadmin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/organisations
Authorization: Bearer {{superadmin_token}}

###

### 2. Créer une deuxième organisation
POST {{baseUrl}}/organisations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{superadmin_token}}

{
  "nom": "SecureBank Finance",
  "type": "entreprise_privee",
  "code_pays": "FR",
  "date_creation": "2020-03-15",
  "email": "contact@securebank.fr",
  "telephone": "+33 1 42 86 12 34",
  "adresse": "123 Avenue des Champs-Élysées, 75008 Paris, France",
  "site_web": "https://www.securebank.fr",
  "code_postal": "75008",
  "ville": "Paris",
  "pays": "France"
}

